{"id":"00212","root":"uni00212_1","name":{"ja":"ドナ・バロウズ","en":"Donna Burroughs"},"title":{"ja":"【ビーチウォリアー】","en":"【Beach Warrior】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ビーチウォリアー】 ドナ・バロウズ","en":"【Beach Warrior】 Donna Burroughs"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-06-30","limited":true,"characterId":54,"profile":{"ja":"米連に所属する対魔族兵士。魔族との攻防戦で右腕を失い、アンドロイドアーム化している。このアンドロイドアームは、彼女専用の武器に封じられた真の力を発揮するためトリガーにもなっている。真の力とは魔族の力、重力である。このため、腕を失ってから彼女の戦績はむしろ上がり、更なる研究の為にと自ら過激な戦場に赴いている。研究の中で味覚が変化し、味覚障害に陥っているが、本人は余り気にしていない。夏に入り、米連の仲間たちも各々休暇を取ってバカンスなどに出かけていたが、戦場に全てを賭すドナは休暇も取らず黙々と自主訓練を行っていた。そんな彼女の元へ、緊急任務が入る。","en":"Donna Burroughs is a Taimanin soldier serving the United States. She lost her right arm in a battle against demons and now has an android arm. This android arm also functions as a trigger that unleashes her true power—demon gravity—sealed within her custom weapon. Since losing her arm, her combat record has actually improved, and she voluntarily seeks out extreme battlefields for further research. The research has altered her taste buds, giving her a taste disorder, though she pays it little mind. As summer arrived, her comrades took vacations, but Donna, who stakes everything on the battlefield, took no break and continued solitary training. An urgent mission then arrives for her."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"叶みゆき","forms":[{"id":"uni00212_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[830,1660],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[108,216],"def":[91,182],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","240009"]},{"id":"uni00212_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1260,2520],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[166,332],"def":[132,264],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","240009","240010"]},{"id":"uni00212_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1690,3358],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[224,450],"def":[173,346],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","24000