uld fight monsters if I came here."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"魔物を見るとこの腕がうずくんだ。戦闘用の義手なのにな……うずくんだよ","en":"Seeing monsters makes this arm tingle. It's a combat prosthetic, yet it still tingles."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"魔物と戦い、殲滅する。ほかのことに興味はないよ。それがドナ・バロウズだ","en":"Fight monsters, annihilate them. Nothing else interests me. That's Donna Burroughs."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"ときおり思い出す……昔食べたアイスクリームの味を。味覚などとうになくなっているのにね","en":"Sometimes I recall... the taste of ice cream I used to eat. Even though my taste's gone."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"さあ戦いだ。待ち望んだ魔物どもを殲滅する機会だぞ！","en":"Alright, battle time. It's the chance we've been waiting for to wipe out those monsters!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"このアンドロイド・アームを知っているだろう？　そう、私がドナ・バロウズだ","en":"You know about this android arm, right? That's right, I'm Donna Burroughs."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"この腕のことは知っているようだな、そう私がドナ・バロウズだ","en":"You seem to know about this arm, huh? Yes, I'm Donna Burroughs."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"魔物どもは私の右腕を奪ったが、代わりにこのアンドロイド・アームという武器を与えた。奴ら自身の処刑人を生み出したのだ","en":"The monsters took my right arm, but gave me this android arm as a weapon instead. They created their own executioner."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni00212_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00212_1/uni002